{"assetCode":"PMP-099","location":"Workshop B","condition":"needs_action","note":"Motor bergetar tinggi"}

### Validation error 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/inspections
Authorization: Bearer training-demo-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"assetCode":" ","location":"Workshop B","condition":"good","note":""}

### Session expired simulation
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/inspections
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Pagination demo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/inspections?page=2&per_page=2
Authorization: Bearer training-demo-token
